0..133 Comment "/// The default build stage: a package\'s `package.gandr.toml` body, rendered by a gandr function from its model\'s fields and modules."
134..137 Comment "///"
138..370 Comment "/// A package\'s own build stage is to write its manifest, the checker\'s fixed rule its default. Before the checker can run a stage, this source shows the default spelled in gandr: each run is the body of a manifest the tree commits."
371..374 Comment "///"
375..647 Comment "/// `body` reads the name, the version and the module list, and writes the `[package]` table as the checker does. The checker keeps the header and its BLAKE3 digest, which only it computes. A name holding a quote is not escaped here: that needs the characters of a string."
648..651 Comment "///"
652..668 Comment "/// - see: #2764"
669..685 Comment "/// - see: #2997"
